six-birds-papers

# Unpublished Six Birds corpus material and internal review scaffolding — keep private.
# external_review/ holds full .tex of unpublished corpus papers + the reviewer zip.
# design/reference/ holds digests of those unpublished papers and absolute local paths.
# .codex/ is the internal Cody/Eddy multi-agent review tooling, prompts, and session logs.
# proposal_glass_unclosed_layer.md is the internal executable build plan for the paper.
